Subject: [PATCH] docs(site): reference for the 2D milling operations

One section per 2D milling and hole kind on main (Face, 2D Contour,
2D Pocket, 2D Adaptive, 2D Offset, Slot, Trochoidal slot, Trace,
Engrave, 2D Chamfer, Circular, Thread, Drill, Bore): purpose and when
to choose it over a neighbour, key settings by tab with the seeded
defaults, geometry picks, and common refusal messages, all read from
the source. Linked from the Operations page; the Milling 2D row there
gains Trochoidal slot; posting/refusals weights shift by one.

Refs #1250

